index 77b595a..30b0f11 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -101,6 +101,8 @@ The dashboard map uses a **local** MaxMind GeoLite2 City file, not a paid GeoIP
 
 The `.mmdb` file is **not committed** (MaxMind license + `.gitignore` `*.mmdb`). Without it the pipeline still runs; the map section shows a notice until coordinates are available. Private IPs (for example `10.x`) are never geolocated.
 
+Optional fallback: set `GEOIP_HTTP_FALLBACK=1` in `.env` to query `http://ip-api.com/json/<public-ip>` when the local database has no result. It is off by default. The client skips non-public IPs, uses a 10-second timeout, and caches results in memory for the current process. Because this endpoint uses plain HTTP, use the local GeoLite2 database for sensitive traffic.
+
 ---
 
 ## 🚀 Usage
